WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.458
Claude just solved

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:02.260
two open black

00:00:02.072 --> 00:00:03.050
hole problems

00:00:03.582 --> 00:00:05.185
Anthropic says Claude

00:00:04.997 --> 00:00:06.435
completed a calculation

00:00:06.247 --> 00:00:07.532
physicists set up

00:00:07.344 --> 00:00:08.287
more than twenty

00:00:08.099 --> 00:00:09.136
years ago but

00:00:08.948 --> 00:00:09.985
never solved

00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.229
It showed the

00:00:11.041 --> 00:00:12.396
sudden transition linked

00:00:12.208 --> 00:00:12.986
to black hole

00:00:12.798 --> 00:00:13.623
formation

00:00:13.824 --> 00:00:15.038
a phase transition

00:00:14.850 --> 00:00:16.252
Hawking and Page

00:00:16.064 --> 00:00:17.927
described in 1983

00:00:18.140 --> 00:00:19.271
persists even where

00:00:19.083 --> 00:00:20.498
spacetime has no

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:21.335
definite shape

00:00:21.854 --> 00:00:22.620
Second

00:00:22.774 --> 00:00:23.457
it found the

00:00:23.269 --> 00:00:24.330
exact limit of

00:00:24.142 --> 00:00:25.238
the simplest version

00:00:25.050 --> 00:00:25.816
of a technique

00:00:25.628 --> 00:00:26.535
used to test

00:00:26.347 --> 00:00:27.502
theories of quantum

00:00:27.314 --> 00:00:27.997
gravity

00:00:28.518 --> 00:00:29.532
Full story on

00:00:29.343 --> 00:00:30.239
the dashboard
